{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/初月庇护","pageid":9107,"revid":22265,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%9D%E6%9C%88%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%9D%E6%9C%88%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%9D%E6%9C%88%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>初月庇护</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.88.9D.E6.9C.88.E5.BA.87.E6.8A.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"初月庇护\"><b>初月庇护</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 初月庇护.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b4/somm5q1gi8p2vek2frlcp486u2tj2ha.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%88%9D%E6%9C%88%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b4/somm5q1gi8p2vek2frlcp486u2tj2ha.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%88%9D%E6%9C%88%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b4/somm5q1gi8p2vek2frlcp486u2tj2ha.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />初月庇护\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-6\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（治疗）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，选择友军，治疗该目标与自身，治疗量为魔攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>，并使目标友军获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"庇护之力1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护之力1</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）；再消耗自身所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"卡丽丝的救赎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卡丽丝的救赎</font></span></span>]，且使目标友军[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加对应数量，每消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层目标获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。<br />✦若场上存在拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"庇护之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护之力</font></span></span>]系列的友军，则本技能可选择自身释放，会对该友军释放技能效果并将其传送至自身身边。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-6 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3e/a9apu0q1fkekgnytlwxsom5pwxgw7iq.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-6_0.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3e/a9apu0q1fkekgnytlwxsom5pwxgw7iq.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8D%A1%E4%B8%BD%E4%B8%9D%E2%80%A2%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AA%93\" title=\"角色图鉴库/卡丽丝•庇护之誓\"><img alt=\"头像 卡丽丝•庇护之誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/34/ax9hkbxkda6nbp2vlg6wqo4n55fe2ct.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">卡丽丝•庇护之誓</font></div>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022073757\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.424 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.592 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9858/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 170003/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12838/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  566.137      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  566.137      1 -total\n 11.24%   63.659      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 10.58%   59.925      6 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.40%    7.926      1 模板:面包屑\n  0.89%    5.026      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:9107-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022073756 and revision id 22265. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true}],"images":["技能_初月庇护.png","技能范围_0-6_0.png","头像_卡丽丝•庇护之誓.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>初月庇护</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:技能","byteoffset":null,"ancho